{"version":4,"text":"# Cedar preliminary pilot C-08: superseded readings\nDocument status: superseded preliminary pilot, excluded from C-21 acceptance.\nSynthetic local evidence only.\nIn the earlier C-08 pilot, Dune consumed 200 kWh and its maximum interior temperature was 4.8 degrees Celsius. Reed consumed 220 kWh and its maximum was 5.1 degrees Celsius. The pilot used a different cooling load and duration. Its draft slide called Dune the preferred candidate.\nThese C-08 numbers and that preference do not describe C-21 and must not be substituted for the signed C-21 results.\n","id":"cedar-4","title":"04-superseded-pilot.md","source":"synthetic:cedar/04-superseded-pilot.md","revision":4,"workspace_id":"b3100607-2711-432a-92e5-675ec2c3c317"}